  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\nWe have,\n\n[2(5)/(13) % of 9100 + 1(1)/(17)% of 10200 + (3)/(5)(17 + 13)]1/3\n\n⇒ [(31)/(13)% of 9100 + (18)/(17)% of 10200 + (3)/(5)(30)]¹/³\n\n⇒ [(31)/(13) × 9100/100 + (18)/(17) × 10200/100 + 3 × 6]1/3\n\n⇒ [(31)/(13) × 91 + (18)/(17) × 102 + 18]1/3\n\n⇒ [31 × 7 + 18 × 6 + 18]¹/³\n\n⇒ [217 + 108 + 18]1/3\n\n⇒ [343]1/3 = 7\n\n**Hence, 7 is the correct answer.**",
